1
00:01:37,770 --> 00:01:42,990
[Shadow Punisher]

2
00:01:43,080 --> 00:01:43,680
[Divine Constable Tally]

3
00:01:43,680 --> 00:01:45,930
[Episode 16]

4
00:01:55,509 --> 00:01:56,310
Look.

5
00:01:57,120 --> 00:01:59,450
Something's not right about this ledger.

6
00:02:03,380 --> 00:02:05,210
[Actual Profit: 9,300 taels]

7
00:02:06,320 --> 00:02:09,030
[Actual Profit: 6,900 taels]

8
00:02:07,790 --> 00:02:09,470
It's so perfectly preserved—

9
00:02:10,080 --> 00:02:10,710
you'd think

10
00:02:10,710 --> 00:02:12,710
it had just fallen from the heavens.

11
00:02:15,590 --> 00:02:17,120
What do you two mean by that?

12
00:02:18,000 --> 00:02:19,380
I worked so hard

13
00:02:19,410 --> 00:02:20,540
to find this ledger.

14
00:02:23,240 --> 00:02:24,710
Actually, when I found it,

15
00:02:24,710 --> 00:02:25,710
I suspected

16
00:02:25,920 --> 00:02:28,079
someone had deliberately left it behind.

17
00:02:28,079 --> 00:02:29,630
Do you know what this means?

18
00:02:30,280 --> 00:02:31,710
It means even Heaven

19
00:02:31,710 --> 00:02:33,280
couldn't tolerate Ji Ada!

20
00:02:45,750 --> 00:02:46,560
Look.

21
00:02:51,310 --> 00:02:53,400
If the poison were on the silver hairpin,

22
00:02:53,400 --> 00:02:55,150
the hairpin should've turned black.

23
00:02:55,150 --> 00:02:55,960
Exactly.

24
00:02:56,310 --> 00:02:57,910
So it wasn't the hairpin.

25
00:02:58,150 --> 00:02:58,950
And Ji Ada's

26
00:02:58,970 --> 00:03:00,080
stab wound

27
00:03:00,080 --> 00:03:01,870
shows no blackening or swelling,

28
00:03:01,870 --> 00:03:02,680
which means the poison

29
00:03:02,680 --> 00:03:03,580
didn't enter his body

30
00:03:03,580 --> 00:03:05,000
through the wound either.

31
00:03:05,000 --> 00:03:08,240
So Old Madam Gong
didn't administer the poison.

32
00:03:09,310 --> 00:03:10,520
Now that's strange.

33
00:03:10,910 --> 00:03:12,710
We all saw it last night.

34
00:03:15,080 --> 00:03:16,630
Well, do you think the poison

35
00:03:16,630 --> 00:03:18,590
was administered
before Old Madam Gong struck,

36
00:03:18,590 --> 00:03:19,960
or after?

37
00:03:23,680 --> 00:03:24,710
It must've been after.

38
00:03:24,710 --> 00:03:25,520
Right.

39
00:03:25,630 --> 00:03:27,680
Otherwise, it'd be hard to control
when the poison took effect.

40
00:03:27,680 --> 00:03:28,910
If the victim suddenly collapsed

41
00:03:28,910 --> 00:03:30,310
halfway through the investigation,

42
00:03:30,310 --> 00:03:32,520
the killer would risk exposing themselves.

43
00:03:32,520 --> 00:03:33,750
Master!

44
00:03:43,610 --> 00:03:44,740
Divine Constables!

45
00:03:44,910 --> 00:03:45,800
Divine Constables,

46
00:03:45,800 --> 00:03:46,660
terrible news.

47
00:03:46,840 --> 00:03:49,000
Gong Le committed suicide
by swallowing gold!

48
00:03:49,000 --> 00:03:49,800
What?

49
00:04:08,520 --> 00:04:09,780
From this day forward,

50
00:04:10,310 --> 00:04:11,520
there will never be

51
00:04:12,280 --> 00:04:14,540
a Gong banner flying on these seas again.

52
00:04:22,680 --> 00:04:23,830
Hurry up, move it!

53
00:04:22,750 --> 00:04:23,950
[Mingling County]

54
00:04:24,600 --> 00:04:25,390
Okay.

55
00:04:25,870 --> 00:04:28,070
Make sure the straw mat is thick enough.

56
00:04:28,630 --> 00:04:29,430
Boatman,

57
00:04:29,510 --> 00:04:30,680
are you sailing today?

58
00:04:30,680 --> 00:04:31,510
No, no.

59
00:04:31,530 --> 00:04:32,860
Put it here. Put it here.

60
00:04:35,560 --> 00:04:36,360
Boatman,

61
00:04:36,680 --> 00:04:37,940
are you sailing today?

62
00:04:38,870 --> 00:04:39,870
Forgive me, ma'am.

63
00:04:39,870 --> 00:04:41,510
Old Madam Gong passed away 2 days ago,

64
00:04:41,510 --> 00:04:42,680
so we all agreed

65
00:04:42,680 --> 00:04:43,870
not to go to sea for 3 days

66
00:04:43,870 --> 00:04:45,270
as a gesture of mourning.

67
00:04:45,480 --> 00:04:46,270
Triple.

68
00:04:46,430 --> 00:04:48,000
I'll pay you triple the fare.

69
00:04:48,000 --> 00:04:49,070
Just take me out to sea.

70
00:04:49,070 --> 00:04:50,800
So what if you're rich?

71
00:04:50,800 --> 00:04:51,820
Back in the day, every ship on this sea

72
00:04:51,820 --> 00:04:53,420
belonged to the Gong family.

73
00:04:54,190 --> 00:04:55,870
It's not that we don't want to earn money.

74
00:04:55,870 --> 00:04:57,930
It's the rule of the Boatmen's Guild.

75
00:04:58,830 --> 00:04:59,630
Five times.

76
00:05:00,870 --> 00:05:01,680
Ten times!

77
00:05:01,680 --> 00:05:03,830
Boatman, I'll pay you 10 times the fare!

78
00:05:03,830 --> 00:05:04,630
Boatman!

79
00:05:06,190 --> 00:05:07,510
In the end, the Gong family

80
00:05:07,510 --> 00:05:09,840
stopped their enemy with their own hands.

81
00:05:11,000 --> 00:05:12,800
This is truly the will of Heaven.

82
00:05:15,510 --> 00:05:16,570
Divine Constable,

83
00:05:16,720 --> 00:05:17,680
a few days ago,

84
00:05:17,870 --> 00:05:19,920
a distant aunt of mine passed away,

85
00:05:20,190 --> 00:05:22,870
and I'm in a hurry
to go back for the funeral.

86
00:05:23,270 --> 00:05:24,600
Go back for the funeral?

87
00:05:25,630 --> 00:05:26,430
I'd say

88
00:05:27,270 --> 00:05:28,680
the place you're hurrying to

89
00:05:28,680 --> 00:05:30,680
is where the Ji family's dirty money

90
00:05:30,720 --> 00:05:31,680
from smuggling government salt

91
00:05:31,680 --> 00:05:33,360
is hidden.

92
00:05:34,310 --> 00:05:35,430
Divine Constable,

93
00:05:35,430 --> 00:05:36,950
you must be joking.

94
00:05:37,040 --> 00:05:38,590
How could the Ji family's

95
00:05:38,800 --> 00:05:41,260
ill-gotten fortune
possibly be in my hands?

96
00:05:41,390 --> 00:05:42,950
You were able to

97
00:05:43,310 --> 00:05:44,570
take Master Ji's life.

98
00:05:45,040 --> 00:05:47,770
Taking his money
would hardly be more difficult.

99
00:05:56,830 --> 00:05:58,010
Master!

100
00:05:58,870 --> 00:06:01,200
Please look into this carefully, My Lord!

101
00:06:01,800 --> 00:06:03,660
I advise you not to try any tricks.

102
00:06:04,070 --> 00:06:05,870
Even if you slip away from me,

103
00:06:06,310 --> 00:06:08,000
the Severe-Cold Sword is still

104
00:06:08,000 --> 00:06:09,460
waiting for you out there.

105
00:06:21,000 --> 00:06:23,360
Whether Lord Meng is
waiting out there or not,

106
00:06:23,360 --> 00:06:24,120
you came here alone

107
00:06:24,120 --> 00:06:26,050
after all, Young Master Qingyang.

108
00:06:26,310 --> 00:06:27,120
I take it

109
00:06:27,720 --> 00:06:29,450
you have something to say to me.

110
00:06:29,510 --> 00:06:30,270
Clever.

111
00:06:30,800 --> 00:06:31,630
Let me ask you.

112
00:06:33,120 --> 00:06:33,980
You were the one

113
00:06:34,720 --> 00:06:36,580
who found the stand-in for Ji Ada.

114
00:06:36,720 --> 00:06:38,000
You were the one

115
00:06:38,120 --> 00:06:39,550
who ordered
the massacre of the Gong family.

116
00:06:39,550 --> 00:06:43,190
[Rice Shop]

117
00:06:40,000 --> 00:06:41,120
It was also you

118
00:06:41,390 --> 00:06:43,870
who pulled the strings
behind the government salt smuggling.

119
00:06:43,870 --> 00:06:45,670
You were sent by the First Prince

120
00:06:45,720 --> 00:06:47,560
to keep an eye on Ji Ada.

121
00:06:48,510 --> 00:06:49,510
Is your real name

122
00:06:50,120 --> 00:06:51,480
Xiuniang

123
00:06:52,510 --> 00:06:53,870
or Xiu Wei?

124
00:06:55,800 --> 00:06:56,870
Who are you?

125
00:07:01,480 --> 00:07:03,010
In the 20th year of Hongyun,

126
00:07:03,270 --> 00:07:05,270
you held a post in the Ministry of War

127
00:07:05,270 --> 00:07:07,330
and sent out a false military report.

128
00:07:07,680 --> 00:07:10,360
After that, you came to Mingling County

129
00:07:10,830 --> 00:07:13,240
and continued working
for the First Prince,

130
00:07:13,240 --> 00:07:15,270
keeping watch
on the Gong and Ji families'

131
00:07:15,270 --> 00:07:17,000
smuggling of government salt.

132
00:07:19,830 --> 00:07:21,510
In this country, you need a travel permit

133
00:07:21,510 --> 00:07:22,630
wherever you go.

134
00:07:24,070 --> 00:07:25,400
Young Master Qingyang,

135
00:07:25,870 --> 00:07:27,630
did you find the travel permit?

136
00:07:28,830 --> 00:07:30,120
Naturally not.

137
00:07:31,430 --> 00:07:33,040
At the end of the day,

138
00:07:33,430 --> 00:07:35,510
everything you said is just speculation.

139
00:07:35,510 --> 00:07:36,570
That's because...

140
00:07:38,630 --> 00:07:41,159
you were born
in Mingling County in Qingzhou.

141
00:07:42,240 --> 00:07:43,770
You came to Mingling County

142
00:07:44,270 --> 00:07:47,070
not to escape trouble
or to conduct official business,

143
00:07:47,070 --> 00:07:48,159
but to return home.

144
00:07:49,720 --> 00:07:51,120
Under the Great Shi Code,

145
00:07:51,120 --> 00:07:52,830
returning to one's hometown
requires no travel permit.

146
00:07:52,830 --> 00:07:53,630
So,

147
00:07:54,040 --> 00:07:54,870
there was never

148
00:07:54,870 --> 00:07:56,830
a Xiu Wei from Tianhuang City.

149
00:07:57,040 --> 00:07:58,300
From beginning to end,

150
00:07:58,720 --> 00:08:00,120
there was only

151
00:08:00,120 --> 00:08:02,050
Xiuniang returning home in glory.

152
00:08:03,240 --> 00:08:05,310
They say you're charming and gallant

153
00:08:05,600 --> 00:08:07,360
and especially gentle with women.

154
00:08:07,360 --> 00:08:08,160
Besides,

155
00:08:08,870 --> 00:08:10,420
what I left behind for you

156
00:08:11,430 --> 00:08:12,920
will surely keep me alive,

157
00:08:12,920 --> 00:08:13,630
won't it?

158
00:08:15,310 --> 00:08:16,120
Looks like

159
00:08:17,190 --> 00:08:18,120
you'd planned

160
00:08:18,120 --> 00:08:19,720
a way out for yourself long ago.

161
00:08:19,720 --> 00:08:20,600
I still have to thank you

162
00:08:20,600 --> 00:08:22,130
on behalf of the people here

163
00:08:22,630 --> 00:08:24,860
for the ledger you left behind

164
00:08:25,070 --> 00:08:26,360
in the fire.

165
00:08:27,270 --> 00:08:27,950
Your Divine Constable Bureau

166
00:08:27,950 --> 00:08:29,510
will need a witness,

167
00:08:30,240 --> 00:08:31,310
and that witness

168
00:08:32,080 --> 00:08:33,669
has to be alive, right?

169
00:08:33,669 --> 00:08:34,799
Rest assured, Miss.

170
00:08:35,080 --> 00:08:38,409
The Divine Constable Bureau
will definitely keep you safe.

171
00:08:39,330 --> 00:08:40,799
Divine Constable,

172
00:08:40,840 --> 00:08:42,960
could it be that you want me to testify

173
00:08:44,840 --> 00:08:46,510
as a witness and expose everything

174
00:08:46,510 --> 00:08:48,440
the First Prince did 17 years ago?

175
00:08:50,200 --> 00:08:52,260
Who are you to the late Fourth Prince?

176
00:08:53,240 --> 00:08:54,080
I only need you

177
00:08:54,080 --> 00:08:56,480
to tell me what you know about
the smuggling of government salt.

178
00:08:56,480 --> 00:08:57,270
As for

179
00:08:58,120 --> 00:08:59,520
what the First Prince did

180
00:08:59,670 --> 00:09:01,200
in the 20th year of Hongyun,

181
00:09:04,510 --> 00:09:06,310
it isn't time to reveal that yet.

182
00:09:15,000 --> 00:09:15,840
Jiuying,

183
00:09:16,870 --> 00:09:17,670
Gong Le...

184
00:09:19,100 --> 00:09:20,670
won't be coming back.

185
00:09:21,860 --> 00:09:27,360
♪ A solitary boat
dividing left and right ♪

186
00:09:22,120 --> 00:09:23,150
Why?

187
00:09:23,630 --> 00:09:24,840
Probably because

188
00:09:26,000 --> 00:09:27,130
he wouldn't be happy

189
00:09:28,080 --> 00:09:29,390
if he came back here.

190
00:09:29,170 --> 00:09:35,200
♪ Amidst the vast, misty waters,
they sail toward the surging tide ♪

191
00:09:31,480 --> 00:09:32,550
Now that he's gone,

192
00:09:34,000 --> 00:09:35,600
he'll never be beaten again.

193
00:09:36,890 --> 00:09:42,670
♪ The rust of old memories
feels like a waking dream ♪

194
00:09:38,790 --> 00:09:41,000
He'll never be beaten again...

195
00:09:42,390 --> 00:09:43,440
Then will I

196
00:09:44,490 --> 00:09:50,250
♪ It hurts to let go,
but I'm holding tightly to emptiness ♪

197
00:09:44,750 --> 00:09:48,670
ever see him again?

198
00:09:51,240 --> 00:09:52,080
You will.

199
00:09:52,070 --> 00:09:55,320
♪ Should we meet across
mountains and seas ♪

200
00:09:53,670 --> 00:09:54,670
One day,

201
00:09:55,440 --> 00:09:56,910
you will see each other again.

202
00:09:56,010 --> 00:09:59,030
♪ If the long road leads to no return ♪

203
00:09:58,670 --> 00:09:59,480
We...

204
00:09:59,710 --> 00:10:05,620
♪ If I can't travel
with you in this life ♪

205
00:10:01,080 --> 00:10:02,510
will all meet again.

206
00:10:06,390 --> 00:10:07,200
Jiuying.

207
00:10:07,520 --> 00:10:10,540
♪ If the lights in my heart ♪

208
00:10:08,240 --> 00:10:09,640
Let me ask you something.

209
00:10:09,670 --> 00:10:10,870
Do you still remember

210
00:10:11,450 --> 00:10:14,460
♪ Become old marks
with the falling snow ♪

211
00:10:11,480 --> 00:10:13,480
where that cave full of bugs

212
00:10:13,790 --> 00:10:14,670
is?

213
00:10:39,030 --> 00:10:40,670
How much longer will it take?

214
00:10:40,840 --> 00:10:42,480
We've never tested it

215
00:10:42,480 --> 00:10:43,480
on animals before,

216
00:10:43,480 --> 00:10:44,360
but it's already

217
00:10:44,360 --> 00:10:46,030
begun to change.

218
00:10:46,360 --> 00:10:48,910
If it can really mutate into a demon wolf,

219
00:10:50,240 --> 00:10:51,910
then Liluo's great cause

220
00:10:53,200 --> 00:10:55,080
will be unstoppable.

221
00:10:56,480 --> 00:10:57,270
Yes.

222
00:11:07,360 --> 00:11:08,390
Wolfie, Wolfie.

223
00:11:08,870 --> 00:11:09,670
Wolfie.

224
00:11:11,150 --> 00:11:11,870
It's me.

225
00:11:12,000 --> 00:11:12,670
Wolfie,

226
00:11:12,750 --> 00:11:14,270
it's me. Don't be afraid.

227
00:12:01,270 --> 00:12:03,400
That beast has successfully mutated.

228
00:12:03,550 --> 00:12:05,260
The demon wolf belongs to Liluo!

229
00:12:05,260 --> 00:12:06,840
No matter where you run,

230
00:12:06,870 --> 00:12:08,360
we will find you!

231
00:12:09,000 --> 00:12:10,390
I see.

232
00:12:12,090 --> 00:12:13,090
So

233
00:12:13,930 --> 00:12:15,960
those glowing bugs

234
00:12:16,410 --> 00:12:17,480
are Chiying bugs.

235
00:12:20,440 --> 00:12:21,480
How vile.

236
00:12:22,730 --> 00:12:24,800
They want to mutate not only humans

237
00:12:25,480 --> 00:12:27,720
but also beasts.

238
00:12:27,910 --> 00:12:28,720
Jiuying,

239
00:12:29,390 --> 00:12:30,150
can you take us

240
00:12:30,150 --> 00:12:31,270
to that cave?

241
00:12:39,030 --> 00:12:39,840
Let's go in.

242
00:13:00,390 --> 00:13:01,600
They're all dead.

243
00:13:08,240 --> 00:13:09,390
According to what you've told us,

244
00:13:09,390 --> 00:13:10,480
Liluo used the venom of Chiying bugs

245
00:13:10,480 --> 00:13:11,480
to mutate humans.

246
00:13:11,760 --> 00:13:12,660
Then these

247
00:13:12,840 --> 00:13:14,600
should be the test subjects
from the demon-men experiments.

248
00:13:14,600 --> 00:13:15,270
But for some reason,

249
00:13:15,270 --> 00:13:16,670
the experiments failed.

250
00:13:20,320 --> 00:13:21,120
Look,

251
00:13:21,240 --> 00:13:22,240
these blood spots

252
00:13:22,600 --> 00:13:24,730
should be from the venomous bug bites.

253
00:13:29,180 --> 00:13:30,900
What strange markings.

254
00:13:32,200 --> 00:13:33,240
Be careful, all of you.

255
00:13:33,240 --> 00:13:34,840
Don't get bitten by the bugs,

256
00:13:34,840 --> 00:13:36,970
or else even I won't be able to cure you.

257
00:13:37,840 --> 00:13:39,390
This is extremely cruel.

258
00:13:40,030 --> 00:13:42,150
Those poor innocent people...

259
00:13:44,360 --> 00:13:45,480
Lou Tianming knew

260
00:13:45,720 --> 00:13:47,650
we would come here sooner or later.

261
00:13:48,200 --> 00:13:50,110
These failed subjects were a burden,

262
00:13:50,110 --> 00:13:51,560
so he left them here.

263
00:14:17,550 --> 00:14:18,670
What are these?

264
00:14:27,040 --> 00:14:28,370
They're so badly drawn.

265
00:14:28,600 --> 00:14:29,670
Even my drawings

266
00:14:30,240 --> 00:14:31,720
would be better than theirs.

267
00:14:31,720 --> 00:14:32,630
Only those

268
00:14:32,790 --> 00:14:34,790
cultists who treat human lives as nothing

269
00:14:34,790 --> 00:14:36,720
would worship

270
00:14:36,720 --> 00:14:38,200
such grotesque evil gods.

271
00:14:48,840 --> 00:14:50,030
Did you get bitten?

272
00:14:53,440 --> 00:14:54,240
It's nothing,

273
00:14:54,720 --> 00:14:56,070
just one sting.

274
00:14:56,790 --> 00:14:58,030
I've been bitten

275
00:14:58,120 --> 00:14:59,390
by these tiny little bugs
several times already.

276
00:14:59,390 --> 00:15:01,390
They won't poison people so easily.

277
00:15:07,030 --> 00:15:07,840
Li Si.

278
00:15:08,770 --> 00:15:10,120
-Li Si!
-Li Si!

279
00:15:10,120 --> 00:15:11,120
-Qingyang.
-Li Si!

280
00:15:11,120 --> 00:15:11,790
Are you alright?

281
00:15:11,790 --> 00:15:13,430
-Qingyang!
-Li Si!

282
00:16:12,320 --> 00:16:13,120
Li Si.

283
00:16:16,120 --> 00:16:16,910
Zhenzhu...

284
00:16:18,390 --> 00:16:19,250
Zhenzhu.

285
00:16:19,390 --> 00:16:21,390
Li Si. Li Si!

286
00:16:27,390 --> 00:16:28,240
Qingyang.

287
00:16:35,200 --> 00:16:36,000
You're awake.

288
00:16:38,030 --> 00:16:39,160
How are you feeling?

289
00:16:39,720 --> 00:16:40,980
You're finally awake.

290
00:16:41,630 --> 00:16:42,490
How do you feel?

291
00:16:45,390 --> 00:16:46,240
Zhenzhu...

292
00:16:46,440 --> 00:16:47,240
I'm here.

293
00:16:49,340 --> 00:16:50,270
Yan.

294
00:16:50,750 --> 00:16:51,680
Are you alright?

295
00:16:56,320 --> 00:16:57,630
Come on, get up.

296
00:17:02,910 --> 00:17:03,840
How do you feel?

297
00:17:04,030 --> 00:17:04,880
Are you okay?

298
00:17:09,310 --> 00:17:10,440
What happened to me?

299
00:17:11,200 --> 00:17:12,829
You were poisoned by a Chiying bug.

300
00:17:12,829 --> 00:17:14,310
I've already drawn out the poisoned blood.

301
00:17:14,310 --> 00:17:15,589
But normally,

302
00:17:15,589 --> 00:17:17,000
with only one bite,

303
00:17:17,000 --> 00:17:18,440
the poison shouldn't have been

304
00:17:18,440 --> 00:17:19,480
this severe.

305
00:17:19,920 --> 00:17:20,720
Right.

306
00:17:21,349 --> 00:17:22,829
I was bitten several times too.

307
00:17:22,829 --> 00:17:23,829
Why am I fine?

308
00:17:24,349 --> 00:17:25,160
Could it be

309
00:17:25,829 --> 00:17:27,890
that they're not the same kind of bug?

310
00:17:28,440 --> 00:17:29,240
Strange.

311
00:17:30,830 --> 00:17:32,550
This is clearly my old ailment—

312
00:17:32,550 --> 00:17:34,000
the burning in my heart meridians—

313
00:17:34,000 --> 00:17:35,540
flaring up again.

314
00:17:36,350 --> 00:17:38,400
Could the Chiying bug venom

315
00:17:38,400 --> 00:17:40,380
have triggered it?

316
00:17:42,400 --> 00:17:44,550
And this time,

317
00:17:45,030 --> 00:17:46,640
it's worse than ever.

318
00:17:49,640 --> 00:17:51,270
If only my master were here.

319
00:18:08,440 --> 00:18:09,700
Lord Constable Ghost,

320
00:18:10,110 --> 00:18:11,710
I've heard so much about you.

321
00:18:11,720 --> 00:18:12,790
Who are you?

322
00:18:13,410 --> 00:18:15,550
Why did you break into the county office
in the middle of the night?

323
00:18:15,550 --> 00:18:17,410
It's all for the half-dead fellow

324
00:18:17,790 --> 00:18:19,500
in there.

325
00:18:19,700 --> 00:18:21,300
You guys may not feel for him,

326
00:18:21,400 --> 00:18:22,680
but as his master,

327
00:18:22,680 --> 00:18:24,440
my heart aches for him.

328
00:18:41,440 --> 00:18:42,400
You brat,

329
00:18:42,920 --> 00:18:44,520
can you stop making me worry?

330
00:18:44,960 --> 00:18:46,030
Don't you know the state

331
00:18:46,030 --> 00:18:47,200
of your own body?

332
00:18:48,120 --> 00:18:49,220
Stop talking.

333
00:18:49,310 --> 00:18:50,480
You stop talking!

334
00:18:51,790 --> 00:18:53,450
Focus on circulating your qi.

335
00:18:56,590 --> 00:18:58,250
Your qi and blood are in chaos.

336
00:19:01,960 --> 00:19:04,560
I've managed to
suppress it for the time being.

337
00:19:06,830 --> 00:19:07,640
You brat.

338
00:19:09,310 --> 00:19:09,960
I can't

339
00:19:09,960 --> 00:19:11,360
be at your side every day.

340
00:19:11,750 --> 00:19:12,830
What will you do next time

341
00:19:12,830 --> 00:19:13,590
this happens?

342
00:19:13,590 --> 00:19:14,520
What will you do?

343
00:19:16,030 --> 00:19:17,630
I still have a few pills here.

344
00:19:18,830 --> 00:19:20,360
Keep them for emergencies.

345
00:19:21,830 --> 00:19:23,310
Take better care of yourself.

346
00:19:23,310 --> 00:19:24,400
Don't push yourself so hard.

347
00:19:24,400 --> 00:19:24,830
Otherwise,

348
00:19:24,830 --> 00:19:26,660
I really don't know
which of us will have to bury the other!

349
00:19:26,660 --> 00:19:27,790
Got it.

350
00:19:32,470 --> 00:19:33,270
Wait,

351
00:19:34,000 --> 00:19:35,110
he's fine now?

352
00:19:35,720 --> 00:19:36,880
Look at him now.

353
00:19:36,880 --> 00:19:38,210
Does he look fine to you?

354
00:19:39,510 --> 00:19:41,040
I really don't understand.

355
00:19:41,960 --> 00:19:43,680
He's a newcomer.

356
00:19:44,000 --> 00:19:45,070
Seniors, please.

357
00:19:45,440 --> 00:19:47,350
He's a rookie!

358
00:19:47,590 --> 00:19:48,400
You seniors,

359
00:19:48,400 --> 00:19:50,510
please take good care of him!

360
00:19:51,000 --> 00:19:51,790
Please.

361
00:19:52,160 --> 00:19:52,960
I'm off.

362
00:19:56,510 --> 00:19:57,310
Meng Rui,

363
00:19:58,110 --> 00:19:59,350
he's my master.

364
00:19:59,590 --> 00:20:00,550
May I ask

365
00:20:01,110 --> 00:20:02,110
why you're able to cure

366
00:20:02,110 --> 00:20:03,170
Chiying bug venom?

367
00:20:04,400 --> 00:20:05,200
First of all,

368
00:20:05,790 --> 00:20:06,550
I don't know

369
00:20:06,550 --> 00:20:08,750
what "Chiying bug venom" is.

370
00:20:09,400 --> 00:20:10,160
Secondly,

371
00:20:11,030 --> 00:20:13,960
this disciple of mine
has always been in poor health.

372
00:20:14,160 --> 00:20:15,400
Whatever ails him,

373
00:20:15,590 --> 00:20:16,830
that's what I treat.

374
00:20:16,830 --> 00:20:18,590
What did you give him just now?

375
00:20:18,720 --> 00:20:19,920
A Resurrection Pill.

376
00:20:20,310 --> 00:20:21,350
Its other name

377
00:20:21,350 --> 00:20:23,080
may sound more familiar to you:

378
00:20:23,510 --> 00:20:26,680
the All-Nourishing Pill.

379
00:20:28,440 --> 00:20:29,400
My Lords,

380
00:20:30,030 --> 00:20:31,070
to be honest,

381
00:20:31,550 --> 00:20:32,960
I have an old illness.

382
00:20:33,550 --> 00:20:34,550
For some reason,

383
00:20:35,000 --> 00:20:36,310
the Chiying bug venom

384
00:20:36,830 --> 00:20:37,790
seems to have triggered

385
00:20:37,790 --> 00:20:39,200
it.

386
00:20:39,960 --> 00:20:41,110
Just now, my master

387
00:20:41,440 --> 00:20:43,440
was only treating my old illness.

388
00:20:45,510 --> 00:20:46,960
No need to make a fuss.

389
00:20:46,960 --> 00:20:48,200
No wonder

390
00:20:48,640 --> 00:20:49,640
I was fine.

391
00:20:50,030 --> 00:20:52,030
Turns out you're just frail.

392
00:20:52,550 --> 00:20:53,720
Then I'm relieved.

393
00:20:56,920 --> 00:20:58,240
His pulse is indeed less alarming

394
00:20:58,240 --> 00:20:59,370
than it was earlier.

395
00:21:01,200 --> 00:21:02,000
Forgive my rudeness.

396
00:21:02,000 --> 00:21:02,960
Not at all.

397
00:21:02,960 --> 00:21:03,960
I lost

398
00:21:03,960 --> 00:21:05,720
my composure a little earlier too,

399
00:21:05,720 --> 00:21:07,750
especially toward you,
Lord Constable Ghost.

400
00:21:07,750 --> 00:21:08,920
Please don't take it to heart.

401
00:21:08,920 --> 00:21:09,990
I'm off!

402
00:21:10,200 --> 00:21:11,330
No need to see me out.

403
00:21:14,830 --> 00:21:16,230
Please excuse my master.

404
00:21:29,960 --> 00:21:31,030
As they say,

405
00:21:31,510 --> 00:21:33,030
the wicked never die.

406
00:21:33,400 --> 00:21:35,030
It's only been 3 days,

407
00:21:33,480 --> 00:21:37,960
[Coroner's Office]

408
00:21:35,310 --> 00:21:37,510
and you're up and running around again.

409
00:21:39,000 --> 00:21:40,130
That's all thanks to

410
00:21:40,440 --> 00:21:42,270
you, Sanhuo.

411
00:21:45,160 --> 00:21:46,030
My Lords.

412
00:21:52,420 --> 00:21:53,730
Are you alright now?

413
00:21:56,550 --> 00:21:57,350
I'm fine now.

414
00:21:57,750 --> 00:21:58,720
Are you alright?

415
00:22:01,180 --> 00:22:02,160
Let me see.

416
00:22:02,440 --> 00:22:03,510
It's my failure

417
00:22:03,530 --> 00:22:04,620
as a local official

418
00:22:04,750 --> 00:22:06,810
that this child has suffered so much.

419
00:22:06,920 --> 00:22:09,160
I leave her in your hands now.

420
00:22:09,590 --> 00:22:10,590
Take her to Tianhuang City more often

421
00:22:10,590 --> 00:22:11,830
and let her see more of the world,

422
00:22:11,830 --> 00:22:14,360
so she can
make something of herself someday.

423
00:22:14,990 --> 00:22:17,590
[Coroner's Office]

424
00:22:24,200 --> 00:22:25,000
Someone

425
00:22:25,400 --> 00:22:27,880
once asked me to take her out

426
00:22:28,550 --> 00:22:30,400
to see the world too.

427
00:22:30,480 --> 00:22:31,270
Alright.

428
00:22:31,590 --> 00:22:32,400
Child,

429
00:22:32,750 --> 00:22:33,640
come with us.

430
00:22:34,880 --> 00:22:36,290
Want some? Not giving you any.

431
00:22:36,290 --> 00:22:36,920
Jiuying,

432
00:22:36,920 --> 00:22:37,720
-ignore him.
-Does your master

433
00:22:37,720 --> 00:22:39,120
follow you on every case?

434
00:22:39,480 --> 00:22:40,550
I can see you two

435
00:22:40,880 --> 00:22:42,590
have a deep bond as master and disciple.

436
00:22:42,590 --> 00:22:43,400
Honestly,

437
00:22:43,420 --> 00:22:45,570
-I was really lucky this time
-Yan, stop teasing her.

438
00:22:45,570 --> 00:22:47,170
that my master happened to be

439
00:22:47,200 --> 00:22:48,240
nearby.

440
00:22:49,670 --> 00:22:50,770
Still,

441
00:22:51,680 --> 00:22:53,880
it really was too much of a coincidence.

442
00:22:54,440 --> 00:22:56,100
I've told you about my master.

443
00:22:56,350 --> 00:22:57,230
Why don't you tell me

444
00:22:57,230 --> 00:22:58,200
about yours?

445
00:23:00,680 --> 00:23:02,480
He's just a wandering martial artist,

446
00:23:02,480 --> 00:23:04,080
not as famous as your master.

447
00:23:04,640 --> 00:23:06,720
There's nothing much to say about him.

448
00:23:06,720 --> 00:23:07,750
Then tell me

449
00:23:08,240 --> 00:23:10,570
why he knows
how to cure Chiying bug venom.

450
00:23:13,720 --> 00:23:15,440
Didn't I tell you already?

451
00:23:15,640 --> 00:23:16,880
The Chiying bugs are tiny,

452
00:23:16,880 --> 00:23:18,240
and they can only
inject a limited amount of venom.

453
00:23:18,240 --> 00:23:19,480
One sting

454
00:23:19,480 --> 00:23:21,080
isn't enough to do much harm.

455
00:23:21,110 --> 00:23:23,830
Your life would be in danger

456
00:23:24,010 --> 00:23:25,870
only if you were chased and bitten

457
00:23:26,310 --> 00:23:28,550
by a swarm of them for 3 days and nights.

458
00:23:31,070 --> 00:23:32,550
Like Sanhuo,

459
00:23:32,920 --> 00:23:35,240
I was poisoned only a little.

460
00:23:35,830 --> 00:23:37,070
I just don't know

461
00:23:37,590 --> 00:23:39,000
why that little bit

462
00:23:40,030 --> 00:23:42,030
happened to trigger my old illness.

463
00:23:47,830 --> 00:23:48,640
Meng Rui,

464
00:23:49,720 --> 00:23:50,480
you're not seriously

465
00:23:50,480 --> 00:23:52,210
suspecting my master, are you?

466
00:23:52,270 --> 00:23:53,750
I think those Chiying bugs

467
00:23:53,750 --> 00:23:55,070
have messed with your head.

468
00:23:55,070 --> 00:23:57,070
You think everyone
is connected to the demon-men.

469
00:23:57,070 --> 00:23:58,330
Isn't it a coincidence

470
00:23:58,550 --> 00:23:59,270
that the Chiying bug venom

471
00:23:59,270 --> 00:24:01,670
just happened to trigger your old illness?

472
00:24:02,440 --> 00:24:04,000
Well, among all the people

473
00:24:04,110 --> 00:24:07,170
in this vast world, why did we happen to
become friends?

474
00:24:07,270 --> 00:24:08,920
It's all fate,

475
00:24:08,920 --> 00:24:10,640
arranged by Heaven.

476
00:24:11,480 --> 00:24:13,680
So what if there are a few coincidences?

477
00:24:14,880 --> 00:24:15,640
How did you and your master

478
00:24:15,640 --> 00:24:16,720
meet?

479
00:24:18,790 --> 00:24:20,310
My master went up the mountain
to gather herbs,

480
00:24:20,310 --> 00:24:21,400
mistook me for ginseng,

481
00:24:21,400 --> 00:24:23,030
and dug me out of the ground!

482
00:24:23,350 --> 00:24:24,160
You...

483
00:24:26,160 --> 00:24:26,960
Li Si!

484
00:24:29,090 --> 00:24:31,680
[Tianshu Pavilion]

485
00:24:32,380 --> 00:24:34,830
[Qipi, God of Lies]

486
00:24:48,270 --> 00:24:49,720
God of Lies,

487
00:24:50,710 --> 00:24:51,840
Qipi...

488
00:24:53,900 --> 00:24:56,840
[Star-Gathering Pavilion]

489
00:24:56,870 --> 00:24:58,780
[Great Shi Treasure Notes]

490
00:25:08,920 --> 00:25:12,240
Someone wants to smuggle government salt
across the Two Rivers and Three Provinces?

491
00:25:12,240 --> 00:25:13,920
It's an inviolable rule
in our Great Shi Dynasty:

492
00:25:13,920 --> 00:25:15,920
salt and iron are
the foundation of the state,

493
00:25:15,920 --> 00:25:17,460
and government salt
must never be sold privately.

494
00:25:17,460 --> 00:25:18,990
What are you talking about?

495
00:25:20,730 --> 00:25:22,290
But I heard that

496
00:25:22,920 --> 00:25:25,000
someone really is
smuggling government salt.

497
00:25:25,000 --> 00:25:25,790
Outrageous!

498
00:25:25,960 --> 00:25:26,680
Then why hasn't
your Divine Constable Bureau

499
00:25:26,680 --> 00:25:27,960
arrested him yet?

500
00:25:29,790 --> 00:25:31,850
But that person is of imperial blood.

501
00:25:32,150 --> 00:25:33,480
He's of imperial blood?

502
00:25:35,590 --> 00:25:36,400
Who?

503
00:25:38,640 --> 00:25:39,840
You may speak freely.

504
00:25:44,480 --> 00:25:46,720
The First Prince, Zhou Miao.

505
00:25:47,270 --> 00:25:48,320
Zhou Miao?

506
00:25:50,240 --> 00:25:52,500
Zhou Miao is smuggling government salt?

507
00:25:54,480 --> 00:25:55,310
Impossible.

508
00:25:56,000 --> 00:25:57,200
How could he have the nerve

509
00:25:57,200 --> 00:25:58,240
to break this iron law?

510
00:25:58,240 --> 00:25:59,550
He'd have to be insane!

511
00:26:00,240 --> 00:26:01,640
It's absolutely true.

512
00:26:20,240 --> 00:26:22,350
Li Qingyang, you're not lying to me?

513
00:26:37,270 --> 00:26:38,070
These are

514
00:26:38,110 --> 00:26:41,070
the letters between the First Prince
and the Ji family of Mingling County,

515
00:26:41,070 --> 00:26:43,200
along with their ledgers.

516
00:26:44,200 --> 00:26:46,130
Please take a look, Your Highness.

517
00:26:51,280 --> 00:26:51,480
[Actual Profit: 9,300 taels]

518
00:26:51,500 --> 00:26:57,510
[Actual Profit: 6,900 taels]

519
00:27:28,240 --> 00:27:29,700
Please calm down, Father.

520
00:27:30,240 --> 00:27:32,680
It appears that the First Prince
has pocketed illicit gains,

521
00:27:32,680 --> 00:27:34,110
bent the law,

522
00:27:34,440 --> 00:27:36,310
smuggled government salt, and colluded

523
00:27:36,310 --> 00:27:38,200
with people outside the palace.

524
00:27:39,680 --> 00:27:40,440
However, my elder brother

525
00:27:40,440 --> 00:27:42,070
must've had a momentary lapse in judgment,

526
00:27:42,070 --> 00:27:43,960
and it led to such a grave offense.

527
00:27:46,200 --> 00:27:48,030
Father, you're wise and discerning.

528
00:27:48,030 --> 00:27:49,890
I implore you,

529
00:27:50,030 --> 00:27:51,680
in light of my elder brother's

530
00:27:51,680 --> 00:27:53,790
long-standing reputation
as a virtuous prince

531
00:27:53,790 --> 00:27:55,920
and his contributions to the country,

532
00:27:56,030 --> 00:27:57,720
to show him leniency.

533
00:28:11,880 --> 00:28:12,790
Xiao Ning.

534
00:28:16,720 --> 00:28:17,780
Yes, Your Majesty.

535
00:28:18,070 --> 00:28:21,000
What do you say,
on behalf of the Ministry of Justice?

536
00:28:21,240 --> 00:28:24,170
I shall look into the matter
fairly and impartially.

537
00:28:25,270 --> 00:28:26,110
Do it, then.

538
00:28:26,480 --> 00:28:27,540
Yes, Your Majesty.

539
00:28:27,880 --> 00:28:30,070
If the Crown Prince's report proves true,

540
00:28:30,070 --> 00:28:31,530
there will be no leniency.

541
00:28:33,880 --> 00:28:34,680
But...

542
00:28:35,640 --> 00:28:38,040
we mustn't wrong the First Prince, either.

543
00:28:38,760 --> 00:28:40,110
The evidence is irrefutable.

544
00:28:40,110 --> 00:28:41,710
What is left to investigate?

545
00:28:41,720 --> 00:28:43,590
I meant for you to look up the penal code!

546
00:28:43,590 --> 00:28:45,030
Where there is precedent, follow it.

547
00:28:45,030 --> 00:28:47,270
Where there is none,
treat him no differently from a commoner!

548
00:28:47,270 --> 00:28:48,070
Guo Anbang!

549
00:28:48,400 --> 00:28:49,460
Yes, Your Majesty.

550
00:28:51,070 --> 00:28:51,880
Yes.

551
00:28:56,640 --> 00:28:58,040
Hear the imperial edict!

552
00:29:00,270 --> 00:29:04,440
By the Mandate of Heaven,
the Emperor decrees:

553
00:29:06,320 --> 00:29:08,670
Zhou Miao is by nature mediocre

554
00:29:08,880 --> 00:29:10,600
and has no merit to his name.

555
00:29:11,200 --> 00:29:13,070
He has abused his authority
for private gain

556
00:29:13,070 --> 00:29:14,830
and is unfit for his post.

557
00:29:15,440 --> 00:29:18,030
He has squandered

558
00:29:18,070 --> 00:29:19,730
his once-worthy reputation,

559
00:29:20,510 --> 00:29:22,270
harming governance
and damaging the public good.

560
00:29:22,270 --> 00:29:23,930
What justification remains?

561
00:29:24,920 --> 00:29:26,310
If such conduct goes unpunished,

562
00:29:26,310 --> 00:29:28,120
how can the law ever be upheld?

563
00:29:29,010 --> 00:29:30,710
His official titles and ranks

564
00:29:30,880 --> 00:29:32,790
shall be stripped.

565
00:29:33,310 --> 00:29:36,170
From today on, his princely title
shall be revoked,

566
00:29:36,790 --> 00:29:38,830
and he shall be confined within the palace

567
00:29:38,830 --> 00:29:40,920
so that we may see whether he reforms.

568
00:29:42,000 --> 00:29:43,630
Thus decreed!

569
00:29:44,480 --> 00:29:46,020
We obey the imperial edict.

570
00:29:46,880 --> 00:29:50,440
His Majesty also has an oral decree.

571
00:29:51,110 --> 00:29:54,440
"I've heard that
the four newly promoted Divine Constables

572
00:29:54,920 --> 00:29:56,640
are all exceptionally
talented and courageous,

573
00:29:56,640 --> 00:29:58,750
with outstanding wisdom and strategy.

574
00:29:58,750 --> 00:30:01,200
I cherish worthy people

575
00:30:01,590 --> 00:30:04,200
and wish to honor
their loyalty and diligence at once.

576
00:30:04,200 --> 00:30:06,880
Summon them for an audience
at the palace!"

577
00:30:13,440 --> 00:30:15,160
Constable Iron, Yan Sanhuo,

578
00:30:15,510 --> 00:30:18,000
you go through hell and high water
to catch criminals,

579
00:30:18,000 --> 00:30:20,800
and the blade in your hand
flashes like lightning.

580
00:30:21,440 --> 00:30:23,000
You come from an aristocratic family.

581
00:30:23,000 --> 00:30:24,480
Three generations of your family
have served the country well.

582
00:30:24,480 --> 00:30:26,140
I'm well aware of your merits.

583
00:30:27,880 --> 00:30:28,750
Meng Rui,

584
00:30:29,440 --> 00:30:31,240
it is said that in Tianhuang City,

585
00:30:31,240 --> 00:30:32,830
children who are not crying

586
00:30:32,830 --> 00:30:34,270
burst into tears in fear

587
00:30:34,270 --> 00:30:36,000
the moment they hear your name,

588
00:30:36,030 --> 00:30:37,070
and those who are crying

589
00:30:37,070 --> 00:30:38,510
stop immediately.

590
00:30:39,110 --> 00:30:41,880
And your Reaper Sword—
those who see it know misfortune is near.

591
00:30:41,880 --> 00:30:43,750
But I never imagined

592
00:30:44,030 --> 00:30:45,240
that you, Constable Ghost,

593
00:30:45,240 --> 00:30:47,790
would be such a handsome young man.

594
00:30:52,270 --> 00:30:53,160
Zhenzhu,

595
00:30:53,720 --> 00:30:55,880
I held you when you were a child,

596
00:30:55,920 --> 00:30:58,580
and now you've grown into
a graceful young lady.

597
00:30:59,400 --> 00:31:00,350
You should've

598
00:31:00,350 --> 00:31:01,830
married into my family long ago,

599
00:31:01,830 --> 00:31:03,960
if it hadn't been for what happened...

600
00:31:17,790 --> 00:31:18,830
All of you

601
00:31:19,480 --> 00:31:21,070
are outstanding.

602
00:31:21,440 --> 00:31:23,030
Having you around

603
00:31:23,310 --> 00:31:24,070
suddenly makes me feel

604
00:31:24,070 --> 00:31:25,830
several years younger myself.

605
00:31:25,830 --> 00:31:27,230
No need for formalities.

606
00:31:27,270 --> 00:31:28,400
Rise, all of you.

607
00:31:28,510 --> 00:31:29,960
Thank you, Your Majesty.

608
00:31:33,350 --> 00:31:34,160
One.

609
00:31:34,960 --> 00:31:35,750
Two.

610
00:31:36,750 --> 00:31:37,550
Three.

611
00:31:44,310 --> 00:31:45,550
Your Majesty,

612
00:31:45,640 --> 00:31:47,110
that fellow Li Qingyang—

613
00:31:48,550 --> 00:31:49,350
no,

614
00:31:50,200 --> 00:31:51,310
Divine Constable Qingyang—

615
00:31:51,310 --> 00:31:52,830
said he had an upset stomach

616
00:31:52,830 --> 00:31:54,790
and simply couldn't hold it in

617
00:31:54,830 --> 00:31:56,400
right before the audience.

618
00:32:01,310 --> 00:32:02,270
Your Majesty,

619
00:32:02,680 --> 00:32:03,480
he...

620
00:32:05,310 --> 00:32:08,000
He said he was afraid of breaching
court etiquette in front of Your Majesty,

621
00:32:08,000 --> 00:32:09,530
so he would be a little late.

622
00:32:09,880 --> 00:32:10,680
Yes.

623
00:32:11,440 --> 00:32:12,440
Your Majesty,

624
00:32:12,440 --> 00:32:13,110
we searched

625
00:32:13,110 --> 00:32:15,270
the entire privy
from top to bottom earlier,

626
00:32:15,270 --> 00:32:17,000
but we just couldn't find Li Si.

627
00:32:47,880 --> 00:32:48,680
Your Majesty,

628
00:32:49,000 --> 00:32:50,880
although Li Si meant

629
00:32:50,880 --> 00:32:51,880
no disrespect,

630
00:32:51,880 --> 00:32:53,440
he has indeed disregarded proper decorum

631
00:32:53,440 --> 00:32:54,440
and behaved recklessly.

632
00:32:54,440 --> 00:32:55,240
Once we return,

633
00:32:55,240 --> 00:32:56,590
I will report this to our Chief

634
00:32:56,590 --> 00:32:57,640
and make sure he is properly disciplined.

635
00:32:57,640 --> 00:32:59,200
Alright, alright.

636
00:33:00,000 --> 00:33:01,600
This isn't a court assembly.

637
00:33:01,680 --> 00:33:03,030
I invited you here

638
00:33:03,030 --> 00:33:03,720
just to see

639
00:33:03,720 --> 00:33:05,850
the finest young talents of our realm.

640
00:33:06,030 --> 00:33:07,550
That's why I asked you here

641
00:33:07,590 --> 00:33:09,070
to have tea as guests.

642
00:33:09,640 --> 00:33:10,440
What?

643
00:33:10,880 --> 00:33:12,110
The guest doesn't show up,

644
00:33:12,110 --> 00:33:14,710
and the host is supposed to
hold it against him?

645
00:33:26,270 --> 00:33:27,070
Eunuch Guo,

646
00:33:27,720 --> 00:33:30,550
you seem to want to say something.

647
00:33:31,510 --> 00:33:32,760
It's been a long time

648
00:33:33,070 --> 00:33:35,690
since I last saw Your Majesty smile.

649
00:33:46,680 --> 00:33:48,980
I was laughing at Li Qingyang.

650
00:33:52,310 --> 00:33:54,640
Do you remember the autumn hunt that year?

651
00:33:55,470 --> 00:33:56,470
The Crown Prince,

652
00:33:56,680 --> 00:33:57,830
the First Prince, and the Third Prince

653
00:33:57,830 --> 00:33:59,630
were all dressed and ready to go.

654
00:33:59,640 --> 00:34:01,920
Only Yan was still
hitching up his trousers,

655
00:34:01,920 --> 00:34:04,200
also claiming
he needed to relieve himself.

656
00:34:04,200 --> 00:34:05,000
As a result,

657
00:34:05,310 --> 00:34:06,510
all the court officials

658
00:34:06,510 --> 00:34:08,190
waited for him for a while.

659
00:34:10,000 --> 00:34:11,360
Some tactless censor

660
00:34:11,400 --> 00:34:12,440
had the nerve to say

661
00:34:12,440 --> 00:34:14,630
that Yan had behaved improperly.

662
00:34:16,280 --> 00:34:17,230
He was angling for a reputation

663
00:34:17,230 --> 00:34:19,090
as a fearless, outspoken censor.

664
00:34:19,630 --> 00:34:20,800
And he dared to

665
00:34:20,920 --> 00:34:23,110
set his sights on my son to do it.

666
00:34:25,440 --> 00:34:26,440
Do you remember

667
00:34:27,480 --> 00:34:29,360
what I said at the time?

668
00:34:30,320 --> 00:34:31,630
Your Majesty said,

669
00:34:33,920 --> 00:34:34,760
"Lord Liu,

670
00:34:35,440 --> 00:34:36,670
nature's call waits for no man.

671
00:34:36,670 --> 00:34:38,070
I now command you

672
00:34:38,230 --> 00:34:40,440
not to use the privy
for 7 days and nights.

673
00:34:40,440 --> 00:34:43,300
Hold it in until you've
squeezed out some decorum!"

674
00:34:45,460 --> 00:34:47,780
[Uphold Virtue and Good Morals]

675
00:34:58,280 --> 00:35:00,070
If anyone in this world dares to bully

676
00:35:00,070 --> 00:35:01,550
my Yan,

677
00:35:02,150 --> 00:35:04,070
I will chop off his head.

678
00:35:04,480 --> 00:35:05,280
Then...

679
00:35:05,590 --> 00:35:06,710
what if it were you

680
00:35:06,710 --> 00:35:08,320
who wronged me?

681
00:35:27,280 --> 00:35:29,150
I broke my promise.

682
00:35:30,630 --> 00:35:32,070
Xuanyuan Shan was right.

683
00:35:34,670 --> 00:35:36,960
Even if I could choose again,

684
00:35:39,070 --> 00:35:41,070
I would still do the same.

685
00:35:41,840 --> 00:35:42,640
Your Majesty,

686
00:35:44,320 --> 00:35:45,830
everything you did

687
00:35:47,590 --> 00:35:49,630
was for the country.

688
00:35:51,230 --> 00:35:54,030
His Highness the Fourth Prince
would understand.

689
00:35:57,280 --> 00:36:00,590
[Uphold Virtue and Good Morals]

690
00:36:02,070 --> 00:36:03,590
I want to walk alone.

691
00:36:04,480 --> 00:36:05,590
Don't follow me.

692
00:36:07,630 --> 00:36:08,440
Your Majesty.

693
00:36:09,670 --> 00:36:10,480
Your Majesty!

694
00:36:50,560 --> 00:36:54,500
♪ Night deepens, spreading like ink
over rivers and mountains ♪

695
00:36:56,800 --> 00:37:00,860
♪ I'm a spark that refuses to die ♪

696
00:37:02,530 --> 00:37:07,420
♪ Riding the wind, a thousand years
pass in a fleeting moment ♪

697
00:37:08,610 --> 00:37:13,780
♪ Seeking the song left unsung ♪

698
00:37:15,140 --> 00:37:20,260
♪ Fleeting light fades
like fragile promises ♪

699
00:37:21,360 --> 00:37:26,900
♪ Who softly sings along
from the far shore? ♪

700
00:37:27,450 --> 00:37:32,680
♪ I'm the poem
that keeps summer nights awake ♪

701
00:37:33,600 --> 00:37:38,790
♪ I'm amber
that defies the passage of time ♪

702
00:37:34,590 --> 00:37:36,190
Your Highness, you mustn't!

703
00:37:36,670 --> 00:37:37,440
Well...

704
00:37:38,280 --> 00:37:39,070
Father.

705
00:37:39,190 --> 00:37:40,000
Yan.

706
00:37:39,800 --> 00:37:45,250
♪ A fleeting glimmer
entwines with eternity ♪

707
00:37:40,000 --> 00:37:40,760
Come on.

708
00:37:41,440 --> 00:37:42,670
Come to me.

709
00:37:43,590 --> 00:37:44,400
Father,

710
00:37:45,190 --> 00:37:46,760
you have gray hair.

711
00:37:46,410 --> 00:37:52,200
♪ Illuminating the stillness of
the Milky Way ♪

712
00:37:47,670 --> 00:37:49,150
I'm getting old.

713
00:37:49,190 --> 00:37:50,550
Having some gray hair

714
00:37:50,590 --> 00:37:52,070
is nothing to be surprised at.

715
00:37:52,070 --> 00:37:53,800
As long as a man achieves great things,

716
00:37:53,800 --> 00:37:55,880
what does gray hair matter?

717
00:37:56,400 --> 00:37:57,440
No, no.

718
00:37:57,190 --> 00:38:01,820
♪ Gracefully dancing
and tracing the contours of a dream ♪

719
00:37:57,590 --> 00:37:59,280
If you have gray hair,

720
00:37:59,280 --> 00:38:01,000
when others bully me in the future,

721
00:38:01,000 --> 00:38:01,880
you won't be able

722
00:38:01,880 --> 00:38:03,510
to stand up for me.

723
00:38:02,910 --> 00:38:08,070
♪ Falling into the water,
stirring ripples that dance and glimmer ♪

724
00:38:03,550 --> 00:38:04,280
If anyone

725
00:38:04,280 --> 00:38:06,880
in this world dares to bully my Yan,

726
00:38:07,800 --> 00:38:09,440
I will chop off his head.

727
00:38:08,730 --> 00:38:14,140
♪ Whose eyes are reflected
in this humble flame? ♪

728
00:38:11,510 --> 00:38:14,150
Yan, did I hurt you?

729
00:38:14,950 --> 00:38:20,970
♪ Stirring waves of turmoil
within his heart ♪

730
00:38:15,760 --> 00:38:16,550
Then...

731
00:38:16,710 --> 00:38:17,920
what if it were you

732
00:38:17,920 --> 00:38:19,510
who wronged me?

733
00:38:22,070 --> 00:38:23,710
You ungrateful little thing.

734
00:38:22,800 --> 00:38:25,520
♪ The past is as fragile as
dew upon wings ♪

735
00:38:24,400 --> 00:38:25,280
I care about you

736
00:38:25,280 --> 00:38:26,360
more than anything.

737
00:38:26,010 --> 00:38:30,390
♪ To fall is, in its own way, to be free ♪

738
00:38:26,400 --> 00:38:27,860
How could I ever wrong you?

739
00:38:28,440 --> 00:38:30,230
Even if I were wronged,

740
00:38:30,230 --> 00:38:31,320
it wouldn't matter.

741
00:38:31,320 --> 00:38:34,050
All I want is for you
not to have gray hair, Father.

742
00:38:35,110 --> 00:38:40,150
♪ I'm the poem
that keeps summer nights awake ♪

743
00:38:41,060 --> 00:38:45,970
♪ I'm amber
that defies the passage of time ♪

744
00:38:43,670 --> 00:38:44,960
What should we do?

745
00:38:45,440 --> 00:38:47,270
Those hairs insist on growing gray.

746
00:38:47,270 --> 00:38:52,610
♪ A fleeting glimmer
entwines with eternity ♪

747
00:38:47,400 --> 00:38:49,190
What can I do?

748
00:38:49,320 --> 00:38:50,110
Father,

749
00:38:50,320 --> 00:38:51,440
from now on,

750
00:38:51,480 --> 00:38:53,510
every time you grow a gray hair,

751
00:38:53,670 --> 00:38:56,030
I'll pluck it for you.

752
00:38:53,700 --> 00:38:59,280
♪ Rewrite the loneliness of
time and space ♪

753
00:39:00,270 --> 00:39:05,140
♪ Let longing become ♪

754
00:39:00,480 --> 00:39:01,280
Alright.

755
00:39:01,670 --> 00:39:02,710
I allow it.

756
00:39:02,840 --> 00:39:05,440
An emperor never breaks his word.
Pinky swear.

757
00:39:05,510 --> 00:39:06,550
An emperor never breaks his word.

758
00:39:05,640 --> 00:39:08,860
♪ Every word whispered on the wind ♪

759
00:39:06,630 --> 00:39:07,840
I promise you.

760
00:39:12,880 --> 00:39:13,670
Come on.

761
00:39:13,670 --> 00:39:15,110
Come to me.

762
00:39:15,110 --> 00:39:15,880
Okay!

763
00:39:21,670 --> 00:39:22,630
Careful, careful.

764
00:39:22,630 --> 00:39:23,440
Leave it to me.

765
00:39:23,440 --> 00:39:24,370
Come on, come on.

766
00:39:30,560 --> 00:39:32,480
[Great Shi Treasure Notes]

767
00:39:33,320 --> 00:39:34,580
The Crown Prince said,

768
00:39:34,590 --> 00:39:37,720
"After you, Zhao Shanlei, joined
the Divine Constable Bureau,

769
00:39:37,720 --> 00:39:40,380
the wanted criminal Lou Tianming ran away.

770
00:39:40,880 --> 00:39:43,070
Look at Li Qingyang.

771
00:39:43,190 --> 00:39:44,110
He joined the Divine Constable Bureau

772
00:39:44,110 --> 00:39:46,840
and immediately helped me
bring down Zhou Miao."

773
00:39:49,440 --> 00:39:51,360
Li Qingyang, Li Qingyang,

774
00:39:51,440 --> 00:39:52,400
you're now

775
00:39:52,400 --> 00:39:53,840
the role model for all of us servants

776
00:39:53,840 --> 00:39:55,440
in the Eastern Palace.

777
00:39:56,670 --> 00:39:58,840
The Crown Prince can't wait to reward you.

778
00:39:58,840 --> 00:40:01,240
Why do you still need to
go out of your way...

779
00:40:01,730 --> 00:40:03,550
to curry favor?

780
00:40:02,490 --> 00:40:04,270
[Great Shi Treasure Notes]

781
00:40:06,670 --> 00:40:07,760
This money

782
00:40:08,440 --> 00:40:10,240
isn't a gift for the Crown Prince

783
00:40:10,630 --> 00:40:12,110
but for you.

784
00:40:16,030 --> 00:40:17,760
The Crown Prince also said

785
00:40:17,920 --> 00:40:19,720
that once he ascends the throne,

786
00:40:21,030 --> 00:40:22,440
he'll have you

787
00:40:22,440 --> 00:40:24,500
take over Xuanyuan Shan's position.

788
00:40:24,880 --> 00:40:27,080
Tell me, the money from the future Chief

789
00:40:27,280 --> 00:40:29,080
of the Divine Constable Bureau—

790
00:40:29,710 --> 00:40:31,840
how could a servant like me

791
00:40:32,430 --> 00:40:34,440
dare to accept it?

792
00:40:35,880 --> 00:40:36,670
Eunuch,

793
00:40:37,070 --> 00:40:39,150
once the Crown Prince ascends the throne,

794
00:40:39,150 --> 00:40:39,960
won't you

795
00:40:40,630 --> 00:40:42,920
become the Head Eunuch
of the imperial palace?

796
00:40:42,920 --> 00:40:43,670
Just like

797
00:40:43,670 --> 00:40:45,230
Lord Guo Anbang is now—

798
00:40:45,670 --> 00:40:47,130
second only to the Emperor

799
00:40:47,440 --> 00:40:48,840
and above everyone else.

800
00:40:51,670 --> 00:40:52,480
How

801
00:40:52,920 --> 00:40:54,760
could I not rely on you?

802
00:40:55,030 --> 00:40:55,880
Well...

803
00:40:58,630 --> 00:41:00,890
That's not something to say carelessly.

804
00:41:02,670 --> 00:41:03,550
Eunuch,

805
00:41:04,920 --> 00:41:05,920
only if you

806
00:41:06,590 --> 00:41:07,920
accept this money

807
00:41:07,920 --> 00:41:09,840
can I feel at ease.

808
00:41:10,230 --> 00:41:11,280
Think about it:

809
00:41:11,320 --> 00:41:13,320
only if you, the future Head Eunuch,

810
00:41:13,630 --> 00:41:16,030
accept a small bribe from me

811
00:41:17,030 --> 00:41:18,630
will you pay more attention

812
00:41:19,710 --> 00:41:21,030
to my affairs.

813
00:41:30,710 --> 00:41:32,320
Well, well, Li Qingyang.

814
00:41:32,670 --> 00:41:34,600
You want to hold something over me?

815
00:41:37,280 --> 00:41:38,190
Remember,

816
00:41:39,440 --> 00:41:40,510
if I accept a bribe,

817
00:41:41,590 --> 00:41:43,650
then you are the one who offered it.

818
00:41:44,430 --> 00:41:46,160
Bribing an imperial eunuch...

819
00:41:46,630 --> 00:41:47,880
Isn't that perfect?

820
00:41:48,030 --> 00:41:48,840
That way,

821
00:41:49,480 --> 00:41:51,140
you also have something on me,

822
00:41:51,440 --> 00:41:53,190
Eunuch.

823
00:41:57,880 --> 00:42:00,140
Exchanging pledges of loyalty like this

824
00:42:00,190 --> 00:42:02,440
makes us true brothers, right?

825
00:42:08,230 --> 00:42:09,210
Eunuch.

826
00:42:10,280 --> 00:42:11,880
Let's leave the future aside

827
00:42:11,880 --> 00:42:13,110
and talk about now.

828
00:42:13,670 --> 00:42:15,720
Nothing stays hidden forever.

829
00:42:16,280 --> 00:42:17,030
I'm guessing

830
00:42:17,630 --> 00:42:19,510
Xuanyuan Shan will find out
sooner or later

831
00:42:19,510 --> 00:42:20,800
that it was me who told the Crown Prince

832
00:42:20,800 --> 00:42:21,950
about the government salt affair.

833
00:42:21,950 --> 00:42:22,840
I'm sure

834
00:42:23,440 --> 00:42:24,920
she'll give me a hard time.

835
00:42:25,670 --> 00:42:27,880
Who does Xuanyuan Shan think she is?

836
00:42:29,590 --> 00:42:30,800
No need to wait.

837
00:42:31,230 --> 00:42:32,840
Let's settle the score right now.
